    "description": "Iranian reservoirs support water supply, electricity generation, irrigation, and flood management, but their performance depends on inflows, sediment, water quality, and operating decisions. Research on Dez Reservoir and Upper Gotvand illustrates why storage infrastructure must be assessed within its river basin.",
    "tags": ["Reservoirs", "Water management", "Sedimentation", "Hydropower", "River basins"],
